[{"id":"ll-base-12-mcq-1","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"mcq","section":"12","section_name":"向量","qno":1,"pdf_page":141,"stem":"若α1,α2，α3 线性相关，α2，α3，α4 线性无关，则( ).","kp_ids":["la.eq.vector"],"part":"base","options":{"A":"α1 可由α2,α3 线性表示 B. α4 可由α1,α2,α3 线性表示","C":"α4 可由α1,α3 线性表示 D. α4 可由α1,α2 线性表示"},"img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-12-mcq-1.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-12-mcq-1.jpg","answer":"A","facets":["dep","represent"]},{"id":"ll-base-12-mcq-2","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"mcq","section":"12","section_name":"向量","qno":2,"pdf_page":141,"stem":"向量组α1,α2, ⋯,αn 线性无关等价于( ).","kp_ids":["la.eq.vector"],"part":"base","options":{"A":"存在一组不全为0 的数, 使其线性组合不为0","B":"存在一个向量不能由其他向量线性表示","C":"任何一个向量均不能由其他向量线性表示","D":"其中任意两个向量线性无关"},"img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-12-mcq-2.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-12-mcq-2.jpg","answer":"C","facets":["dep","represent"]},{"id":"ll-base-12-mcq-3","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"mcq","section":"12","section_name":"向量","qno":3,"pdf_page":141,"stem":"设向量组α1,α2,α3,α4 线性无关，则下列向量组线性无关的是( ).","kp_ids":["la.eq.vector"],"part":"base","options":{"A":"α1 + α2,α2 + α3,α3 + α4,α4 + α1 B. α1 + α2,α2 + α3,α3 + α4,α4 - α1","C":"α1 + α2,α2 - α3,α3 + α4,α4 - α1 D. α1 - α2,α2 - α3,α3 - α4,α4 - α1"},"img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-12-mcq-3.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-12-mcq-3.jpg","answer":"B","facets":["dep"]},{"id":"ll-base-12-mcq-4","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"mcq","section":"12","section_name":"向量","qno":4,"pdf_page":142,"stem":"设向量组(I)β1,β2, ⋯,βt，(II)α1,α2, ⋯,αs，则下列命题:\n①若向量组(I) 可由(II) 线性表示，且s < t，则必有(I) 线性相关，\n②若向量组(II) 可由(I) 线性表示，且s < t，则必有(I) 线性相关，\n③若向量组(I) 可由(II) 线性表示，且(I) 线性无关，则必有s ≥t，\n④若向量组(II) 可由(I) 线性表示，且(I) 线性无关，则必有s ≥t，正确的是( ).","kp_ids":["la.eq.vector"],"part":"base","options":{"A":"①④","B":"①③","C":"②③","D":"②④"},"img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-12-mcq-4.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-12-mcq-4.jpg","answer":"B","facets":["represent","dep"]},{"id":"ll-base-12-mcq-5","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"mcq","section":"12","section_name":"向量","qno":5,"pdf_page":142,"stem":"设α1 = a1,a2,a3 T,α2 = b1,b2,b3 T,α3 = c1,c2,c3 T, 其中a2 i + b2 i ≠0 i=1,2,3 , 则3 条直线aix\n+ biy + ci = 0 i=1,2,3 恰好仅交于一点的充分必要条件是( ).","kp_ids":["la.eq.vector"],"part":"base","options":{"A":"r α1,α2,α3 = 3 B. r α1,α2,α3 = 1","C":"r α1,α2,α3 = r α1,α2 D. r α1,α2,α3 = r α1,α2 = 2"},"img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-12-mcq-5.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-12-mcq-5.jpg","answer":"D","facets":["vector_rank"]},{"id":"ll-base-12-mcq-6","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"mcq","section":"12","section_name":"向量","qno":6,"pdf_page":142,"stem":"设α1,α2,α3 均为3 维向量, 则对任意常数k 和μ, 向量组α1 + kα3,α2 + μα3 线性无关是向量组α1,α2,\nα3 线性无关的( ).","kp_ids":["la.eq.vector"],"part":"base","options":{"A":"充分必要条件 B. 充分非必要条件","C":"必要非充分条件 D. 既非充分又非必要条件"},"img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-12-mcq-6.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-12-mcq-6.jpg","answer":"C","facets":["dep"]},{"id":"ll-base-12-fill-1","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"fill","section":"12","section_name":"向量","qno":1,"pdf_page":143,"stem":"已知向量组α1 = 1,2,3 T,α2 = 2,-1,1 T,α3 = -2,k,4 T 线性相关，则k = _____.","kp_ids":["la.eq.vector"],"part":"base","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-12-fill-1.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-12-fill-1.jpg","facets":["dep"]},{"id":"ll-base-12-fill-2","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"fill","section":"12","section_name":"向量","qno":2,"pdf_page":143,"stem":"已知3 维线性空间的一组基为α1 = 1,1,0 ,α2 = 1,0,1 ,α3 = 0,1,1 , 则向量β = 2,0,0 在上述\n基下的坐标为_____.","kp_ids":["la.sp.basis"],"part":"base","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-12-fill-2.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-12-fill-2.jpg","facets":["basis"]},{"id":"ll-base-12-fill-3","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"fill","section":"12","section_name":"向量","qno":3,"pdf_page":143,"stem":"设3 维向量空间的两组基分别为α1 = 1,2,3 T,α2 = 2,3,1 T,α3 = 3,1,2 T;β1 = (-1, -1, 2)T,β2\n= -1,2,-1 T,β3 = 3,1,2 T, 则从α1,α2,α3 到β1,β2,β3 的过渡矩阵为_____.","kp_ids":["la.sp.basis"],"part":"base","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-12-fill-3.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-12-fill-3.jpg","facets":["transition"]},{"id":"ll-base-12-big-1","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"12","section_name":"向量","qno":1,"pdf_page":144,"stem":"设向量组α1 = 1,1,1,2 T,α2 = 3,a+4,2a+5,a+7 T,α3 = 4,6,8,10 T,α4 = (2,3,2a + 3,5)T,α =\n0,1,3,b T.\n(I) 求向量组α1,α2,α3,α4 的秩及其一个极大线性无关组;\n(II) 若α 不能由α1,α2,α3,α4 线性表示, 求a,b 的取值.","kp_ids":["la.eq.vector"],"part":"base","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-12-big-1.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-12-big-1.jpg","facets":["vector_rank","max_ind","represent"]},{"id":"ll-base-12-big-2","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"12","section_name":"向量","qno":2,"pdf_page":144,"stem":"设向量组α1 = 0,4,2 T,α2 = 1,1,0 T,α3 = -2,4,3 T,α4 = -1,1,1 T, 求α1,α2,α3,α4 的一个极大\n线性无关组, 并将其余向量用极大线性无关组线性表示.","kp_ids":["la.eq.vector"],"part":"base","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-12-big-2.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-12-big-2.jpg","facets":["max_ind","represent"]},{"id":"ll-base-12-big-3","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"12","section_name":"向量","qno":3,"pdf_page":145,"stem":"设α1 = 1,0,2,3 T,α2 = 1,1,3,5 T,α3 = 1,-1,a,1 T,β = 1,b,4,7 T, 问a,b 为何值时, β 不能由α1,\nα2,α3 线性表示;a,b 为何值时, β 可由α1,α2,α3 线性表示, 并写出表达式.","kp_ids":["la.eq.vector"],"part":"base","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-12-big-3.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-12-big-3.jpg","facets":["represent"]},{"id":"ll-base-12-big-4","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"12","section_name":"向量","qno":4,"pdf_page":145,"stem":"设向量组α1 = 1,2,-3 T,α2 = 3,0,1 T,α3 = 9,6,-7 T 与向量组β1 = 0,1,-1 T,β2 = k,2,1 T,β3\n= μ,1,0 T 有相同的秩, 且β3 可由α1,α2,α3 线性表示, 求k,μ 的值.","kp_ids":["la.eq.vector"],"part":"base","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-12-big-4.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-12-big-4.jpg","facets":["vector_rank","represent"]},{"id":"ll-base-12-big-5","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"12","section_name":"向量","qno":5,"pdf_page":146,"stem":"设向量组(I):α1 = 1,3,0,5 T,α2 = 1,2,1,4 T,α3 = 1,1,2,3 T; II :β1 = (1, -3,6, -1)T,β2 =\na,0,b,2 T.若向量组(I) 与(II) 等价, 求a,b 的值.","kp_ids":["la.eq.vector"],"part":"base","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-12-big-5.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-12-big-5.jpg","facets":["equiv"]},{"id":"ll-base-12-big-6","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"12","section_name":"向量","qno":6,"pdf_page":146,"stem":"设向量组I α1,α2,α3, II α1,α2,α3,α4, III α1,α2,α3,α5, 且r I = r II = 3,r III = 4,证明: 向量\n组α1,α2,α3,α5 - α4 的秩为4.","kp_ids":["la.eq.vector"],"part":"base","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-12-big-6.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-12-big-6.jpg","facets":["vector_rank"]},{"id":"ll-base-12-big-7","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"12","section_name":"向量","qno":7,"pdf_page":147,"stem":"设A 是3 阶方阵, α1,α2 为A 的分别属于特征值-2,1 的特征向量, 且Aα3 = α2 + α3, 证明:α1, α2,α3\n线性无关.","kp_ids":["la.eq.vector","la.eig.value"],"part":"base","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-12-big-7.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-12-big-7.jpg","facets":["dep"]},{"id":"ll-base-12-big-8","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"12","section_name":"向量","qno":8,"pdf_page":147,"stem":"设矩阵A5×4 的秩为2,α1 = 1,1,2,3 T,α2 = -1,1,4,-1 T,α3 = 5,-1,-8,9 T 是方程组Ax = 0 的\n解向量，求Ax = 0 的解空间的一组标准正交基.","kp_ids":["la.sp.ortho","la.eq.structure"],"part":"base","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-12-big-8.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-12-big-8.jpg","facets":["schmidt"]}]